brown/](https://instagram.com/hablotbrown/)\n\n### Credits\n\nReleased July 29th, 2018\nMixed & Mastered by Joshua Pleeter & Austin Brown\nArtwork: Andre Power\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7226,"location":"JP","published_at":"2018-07-28T11:57:25+00:00"},"title":"Yukibeb Set","position":1}},{"id":"m2ONA3IcbkE","position":28,"timestamp":"01:00:35","rawTrack":"Daniel Caesar - Who Hurt You?","track":{"id":"U9LZNKOGnfc","path":"/artists/daniel-caesar/tracks/who-hurt-you/","slug":"who-hurt-you","title":"Who Hurt You?","artist":{"slug":"daniel-caesar","title":"Daniel Caesar"},"artwork":"images/artists/daniel-caesar/tracks/who-hurt-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"FqRpiFhpfLA","slug":"381","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/episode-381/ra.1439706917","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-381-ft-tom-misch"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #381 w/ Tom Misch","artwork":"/images/episodes/381.jpg","content":"[Tom Misch](https://tommisch.com/) joins Joe Kay for an interview and live performance featuring songs from his debut album \"Geography\".\n\n\n<!--more-->\n\nWatch [Interview](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FWXDqqPKJAs) and [Live Performance](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aAFbvMUD5SU) on YouTube.\n\nFind Tom Misch on [Apple Music](https://geo.itunes.apple.com/us/album/geography/1327772541?mt=1&app=music&at=1010lMz4), [Amazon Music](https://www.amazon.co.uk/gp/product/B07BS65JQX/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&tag=soulectiontracklists-21&camp=1634&creative=6738&linkCode=as2&creativeASIN=B07BS65JQX&linkId=eb8c716078ae79501cff56ff5f98735d), [SoundCloud](https://soundcloud.com/tommisch), [Spotify](https://open.spotify.com/artist/1uiEZYehlNivdK3iQyAbye) [YouTube](http://www.youtube.com/tommisch), [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/tommisch/) [Facebook](http://www.facebook.com/tommisch123), and [Twitter](http://www.twitter.com/tommisch)\n\n{{< youtube aAFbvMUD5SU >}}\n","profile":"Q